<section id="effective-date">
<h2>Effective Date</h2>
<p>This Notice of Privacy Practices is effective as of October 5, 2026.</p>
<p>Neurosolace Behavioral Health reserves the right to revise this notice as necessary to comply with changes in federal or Maryland law and changes in our privacy practices.</p>
<p>A current copy of this notice will be available on the Neurosolace Behavioral Health website and upon request.</p>
</section>
